     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "Register 0x1FA starts the INT1 timer: a write clears the interrupt line and, with bit 0 of 0x1FE set, schedules the timer.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c140.cpp",
       "lines": "535-541",
       "sha": "f4c0c2682341e0b8dd4e46cfeeafbf6dec15e794b7c2666af6abea23665d3b0f"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "With bit 0 of 0x1FE clear, a write to 0x1FA clears the line and schedules nothing.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/c140.cpp",
       "lines": "535-541",
       "sha": "f4c0c2682341e0b8dd4e46cfeeafbf6dec15e794b7c2666af6abea23665d3b0f"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "when",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "The timer's expiry asserts the INT1 line through the device's callback.",
